# Immich Power Tools app secrets (SOPS).
#
# One required value: IMMICH_API_KEY. Generate it in Immich
# (Account → API Keys, grant ALL permissions) and encrypt:
#
#   cd apps/base/immich-power-tools
#   SOPS_AGE_KEY_FILE=~/.config/sops/age/homelab-keys.txt \
#     sops edit immich-power-tools-api-key.secret.yaml
#
# The deployment reads IMMICH_API_KEY from this secret. Power Tools also
# reaches the Immich Postgres DB directly via the shared
# `homelab-postgres-immich` credentials (DB_USERNAME/DB_PASSWORD), see
# deployment.yaml — no separate DB user/secret required.
